retained.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Retain the approved paper drums. Lower all swell source amplitudes from 0.3 to 0.2 (-3.52 dB). Give the tense-only Reese modest presence: cutoff 650 to 900 Hz, drive 0.4 to 0.48, resonance 0.25 to 0.28, index 0.002 to 0.003 and slow index motion 0.0015 to 0.0025; preserve spread, envelope and motion rate. Raise its 272 accents by 3 (36/39 to 39/42) and default 39 to 42. Preserve all pitches, rhythm, gates, effects, calm bass, musical parts, sections and bus. Paper Kit I retained.") ("m1 (marks from the documented layout)" "2026-09-21" "set marks calm: 0 fill: 7 tense: 8"))))
